{
 "encounter_id": "00989",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It's my face. Flaky and red, next to my nose."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How long?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Three months."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Itchy?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes. Worse when I'm hot."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anything on the scalp?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Dandruff. Always."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Is your skin greasy?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Very, on the nose and forehead."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any patches elsewhere on the face?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Eyebrows. Red patches there too."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any pus or weeping?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No pus."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Fever?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No fever."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any new products on your face lately?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No new products."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What are you using on it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ketoconazole shampoo, twice a week. A moisturiser, twice a day. Cetirizine, 10 mg, at night. And a white cream from the dermatologist, I don't know the name."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "We'll find that cream on your record. Any allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Nickel. I get a rash from watch straps."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Skin history?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Eczema as a child. And acne as a teenager."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any operations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A mole removed, in 2016. And my tonsils, as a child."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Skin problems in the family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My mother has psoriasis."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What do you do?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Baker. Hot ovens all day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Alcohol?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Weekends only, a few beers."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check you. Blood pressure 120 over 74, pulse 70.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I can see red, flaky patches along both sides of the nose and in the eyebrows."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And scaling on the scalp."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's the dandruff. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any joint pain?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "This looks like seborrhoeic dermatitis, but I can't rule out rosacea."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "What's the difference? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Rosacea has flushing and spots. We'll see. I'd like to arrange a skin scraping to check for fungus, and patch testing, given your nickel reaction."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Use the shampoo on your face as well, leave it on for five minutes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in four weeks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Four weeks. ~"
  }
